text: >-
  John Cullen * @I_Am_JohnCullen • 17m

  Why would the communication records from Provo airport be classified,

  and "used for an ongoing investigation" into a transsexual furry with a

  Mauser 98 that lives 3.5 hours south?

  @FBIDirectorKash

  h/t @DaveCharbonneau

  GRAMA Request - Denial D Inbox x

  Heidi Allman

  to me y

  @provo.gov>

  Hello Dave,

  & Z

  5:04PM (1 hour ago)

  Unfortunately, Provo City is not allowed to release the requested records. The
  records are being

  used in an ongoing investigation and have been classified as protected under
  Utah Code § 63G-2-

  305(10).

  Please see the attached denial letter which includes appeal information.

  Best,

  HEIDI ALLMAN, CMC UCC

  ADMINISTRATIVE SERVICES

  CITY RECORDER

  TEL (801) 852-6524
